    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Les Vacances De Felix, in Fréjus, is a boarding facility that takes in both dogs and cats with accommodation — unlike home sitting, here the animal is boarded on site. The facility describes itself as intimate, with only 5 boarding spots, which in theory allows for more personalised care than a large group boarding facility.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The advertised services include tailored meals, daily walks and 24/7 supervision. The facility's existence and address are cross-checked by several sources (PagesJaunes, Mappy and the official website), giving a good level of confidence in the practical information. Prices, however, are not published: it's best to call before committing, especially given the limited number of spots.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: with only 5 spots, book well ahead if you're travelling in high season on the Côte d'Azur.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Fréjus's historic centre and its beaches are a few minutes away.</p>
